            <ArticleTitle>Draft Genome Sequence of Sphingobium fuliginis OMI, a Bacterium That Degrades Alkylphenols and Bisphenols.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01323-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01323-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Sphingobium fuliginis OMI is a bacterium that can degrade a variety of recalcitrant alkylphenols and bisphenols. This study reports the draft genome sequence of S. fuliginis OMI.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Copyright © 2017 Kuroda et al.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
